# Storage law (TODO.deploy/1 and /5) - this repository carries ZERO Git LFS.
#
# Browser-facing artifacts are plain git blobs, served CORS-open from
# raw.githubusercontent.com (verified: access-control-allow-origin: *):
#   mini tiers + their vocab jsons, packs/*.bin, models/lid/*,
#   models/typo/*, and the demo languages' bucket tables
#   (models/en/fasttext.en.buckets.onnx today).
#
# Everything else - full/fluency/buckets onnx, *.ktm1 matrices - lives as
# a release asset only and is NEVER committed to git (mirror: null in
# the registry; release uploads are quota-free and unmetered).
#
# Hard constraints, learned 2026-09-18/19:
#   - plain git files must stay under 100 MiB (GitHub push limit);
#   - NEVER reintroduce Git LFS: on a free account its quota blocks all
#     pushes, deleting the repository does not reset the accounting, and
#     a support-triggered rebuild may not propagate.
